{"about_the_game":"Welcome to the world of Molten Maze \u2014 an exciting 3D platformer-puzzle, where every movement you make matters! <br />\r\nPrepare for an incredible challenge, as beneath your feet lies not just a floor, but a seething lava terrain!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nIn this game, you'll need to become a master of strategy, adaptation, and ingenuity. <br />\r\nEach level offers unique challenges where you must move blocks to create a safe path to the exit. Lava is everywhere: it floods the ground, and every wrong step could be fatal! <br />\r\nBut don't worry! The puzzles will help develop your logical thinking and provide countless hours of engaging gameplay.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nGame Features:<br />\r\n<br />\r\nCaptivating 3D gameplay<br />\r\nUnique levels<br />\r\nStrategic thinking<br />\r\nLogical puzzles<br />\r\nIntuitive controls","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3451470?t=1748182579","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3451470?t=1748182579","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451470/aa7412e0fc50f9b2197f2d9221a977ebaf9c3519/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748182579","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451470/aa7412e0fc50f9b2197f2d9221a977ebaf9c3519/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1748182579","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"Welcome to the world of Molten Maze \u2014 an exciting 3D platformer-puzzle, where every movement you make matters! <br />\r\nPrepare for an incredible challenge, as beneath your feet lies not just a floor, but a seething lava terrain!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nIn this game, you'll need to become a master of strategy, adaptation, and ingenuity. <br />\r\nEach level offers unique challenges where you must move blocks to create a safe pa